sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / Dashboard
    participant Route as OpenShift Route<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant API as DS Pipelines API Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP | 8887/TCP gRPC
    participant MariaDB as MariaDB<br/>3306/TCP MySQL
    participant Argo as Argo Workflow Controller
    participant Pods as Pipeline Pods
    participant S3 as S3 Storage (MinIO/External)<br/>9000/TCP HTTP
    participant PA as Persistence Agent
    participant MLMD as MLMD gRPC Server<br/>8080/TCP gRPC
    participant Envoy as MLMD Envoy Proxy<br/>9090/TCP gRPC-web
    participant DSPO as DSPO Controller
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over User,S3: Flow 1: Pipeline Execution
        User->>Route: POST /apis/v2beta1/runs<br/>Auth: OpenShift OAuth
        Route->>KRBP: Forward (TLS reencrypt)
        KRBP->>KRBP: SubjectAccessReview
        KRBP->>API: HTTP 8888/TCP<br/>Optional pod-to-pod TLS
        API->>MariaDB: Store pipeline run<br/>MySQL 3306/TCP<br/>DB credentials
        API->>Argo: Create Workflow CR<br/>ServiceAccount RBAC
        Argo->>Pods: Execute pipeline steps<br/>Pod exec
        Pods->>S3: Upload artifacts<br/>HTTP/HTTPS 9000/TCP<br/>S3 credentials
        PA->>API: Sync run state<br/>gRPC 8887/TCP<br/>Optional TLS
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over Pods,MariaDB: Flow 2: ML Metadata Access
        Pods->>MLMD: Store execution metadata<br/>gRPC 8080/TCP<br/>Optional pod-to-pod TLS
        MLMD->>MariaDB: Persist metadata<br/>MySQL 3306/TCP
        User->>Route: Access metadata<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP
        Route->>KRBP: Forward (TLS reencrypt)
        KRBP->>Envoy: gRPC-web 9090/TCP<br/>SubjectAccessReview
        Envoy->>MLMD: gRPC 8080/TCP
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over DSPO,OCI: Flow 3: Managed Pipelines Import
        DSPO->>OCI: Pull managed-pipelines.json<br/>HTTPS 443/TCP<br/>Registry credentials
        OCI-->>DSPO: OCI manifest<br/>Image digest validation
        DSPO->>API: Configure init-managed-pipelines<br/>container with shared volume
        Note over API: API Server imports pipelines<br/>from shared volume on startup
    end
